      "body": "## Bevy version\r\n14 rc4\r\nThe release number or commit hash of the version you're using.\r\n\r\nused this commit: `011f71a24520d1401b1d890a0c088c4ae7d41fb6`\r\n## \\[Optional\\] Relevant system information\r\nMacBook Pro M1. v14.3\r\nUsing Chrome Browser. (`Version 126.0.6478.127 (Official Build) (arm64)`)\r\n\r\nIf you cannot get Bevy to build or run on your machine, please include:\r\n\r\n- the Rust version you're using (you can get this by running `cargo --version`)\r\n```\r\n$ cargo --version\r\ncargo 1.79.0 (ffa9cf99a 2024-06-03)\r\n```\r\n  - Bevy relies on the \"latest stable release\" of Rust\r\n  - nightly should generally work, but there are sometimes regressions: please let us know!\r\n- the operating system or browser used, including its version\r\n  - e.g. Windows 10, Ubuntu 18.04, iOS 14\r\n\r\nIf your bug is rendering-related, copy the adapter info that appears when you run Bevy.\r\n\r\n\r\n## What you did\r\n\r\nTry to run my game in the web browser / wasm build.\r\n\r\n## What went wrong\r\n\r\nGame errors out before loading:\r\n\r\n- `Error adding plugin bevy_app::panic_handler::PanicHandlerPlugin in group bevy_internal::default_plugins::DefaultPlugins: plugin was already added in application`\r\n- `Unable to find a GPU! Make sure you have installed required drivers!`\r\n\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1178\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-06-28 at 4 20 56\u202fPM\" src=\"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/assets/7761473/236e51bc-48f7-48b2-b3c5-6fa3667f5d16\">\r\n\r\n## Note: \r\n- This game with latest version of rustc and cargo works fine for bevy 13.2.\r\n- Not sure if this is only for Mac or not.",
